002> 存在同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0006>\n它们相互配合，给出如下同构（isomorphism），该映射保持<MATH_0007>-分次（graded）代数（algebras）的结构\n<MATH_0008>\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个开集（open）<MATH_0009>，下列图表（diagrams）\n<MATH_0010>\n均交换（commutative）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 按需要在此补充更多内容。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:3d658387ab9fa2f010e9a94dfdd978fc383e58afdffb3749def387ec8f8421cb", "unit_id": "tag:02NC:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "用于引理所断言的具有典范性的同构。", "source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"context": "用于第一项性质中存在的多个同构。", "source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "用于由前述多个同构共同给出的同构。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "用于描述此处代数的分次结构。", "source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"context": "用于此处分次同构两端的代数。", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "用于第二项性质中全称量化的开集。", "source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"context": "用于第二项性质中陈述交换性的多个图表。", "source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表"}, {"context": "用于断言图表的交换性。", "source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}]}
